<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Frost Death Knights</span></h2>This is an example of the best-in-slot gear available from all PvE sources available before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift. <br/>
<br/>This gearset omits loot from The Celestial Court and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=72057/ordos">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ordos</span></a> due to the RNG nature of world bosses. <br/>
<br/>Similarly, additional item level can be gained by relentlessly farming <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103982/burden-of-eternity">
<img alt="Burden of Eternity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_monk_envelopingmist.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burden of Eternity</span></a>. You can somewhat reasonably expect to obtain 2-3 while putting in a few hours of work on the island.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
