<img alt="Malkorok's Tainted Dog Tags" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_mop7.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malkorok's Tainted Dog Tags</span></a></td>
<td>30 <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_01.gif");'></span></td>
