<img alt="Pauldrons of Cyclopean Dread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Cyclopean Dread</span></a></td>
