<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Frost Death Knights</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes Rare Mobs, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50352/qunas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas</span></a>, but also World Bosses, such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop item level 553 Tier 16.<br/>
<br/>Receiving item level 553 tier gear will be by far the best obtainable gear before stepping into raid. Clearing the celestial world bosses each week should be a priority.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99193/gauntlets-of-cyclopean-dread">
<img alt="Gauntlets of Cyclopean Dread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gauntlets of Cyclopean Dread</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99186/greaves-of-cyclopean-dread">
<img alt="Greaves of Cyclopean Dread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of Cyclopean Dread</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos drops some decent pieces, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105766/anafielles-spiked-choker">
<img alt="Anafielle's Spiked Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anafielle's Spiked Choker</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105767/hoodrychs-bloodied-chestplate">
<img alt="Hoodrych's Bloodied Chestplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hoodrych's Bloodied Chestplate</span></a>. These are fairly rare, but can be nice items until you step into raid, as they are equivalent to Normal difficulty items.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105766/anafielles-spiked-choker">
<img alt="Anafielle's Spiked Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anafielle's Spiked Choker</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105767/hoodrychs-bloodied-chestplate">
<img alt="Hoodrych's Bloodied Chestplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hoodrych's Bloodied Chestplate</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105807/magdalenas-murderous-crown">
<img alt="Magdalena's Murderous Crown" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magdalena's Murderous Crown</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105759/magmaplates-of-jian-wu-xi-feng">
<img alt="Magmaplates of Jian Wu Xi Feng" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magmaplates of Jian Wu Xi Feng</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_hunter_pet_devilsaur.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta is the T15-equivalent of Galleon, offering a wide range of rare epic items, as well as a very small chance of dropping the mount <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94228/reins-of-the-cobalt-primordial-direhorn">
<img alt="Reins of the Cobalt Primordial Direhorn" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_triceratopsmount_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Cobalt Primordial Direhorn</span></a>. Drops include items such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95153/tyrant-king-battleplate">
<img alt="Tyrant King Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrant King Battleplate</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95192/belt-of-the-tyrannotitan">
<img alt="Belt of the Tyrannotitan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tyrannotitan</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95199/carnotaur-battlegloves">
<img alt="Carnotaur Battlegloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carnotaur Battlegloves</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95180/overcompensating-chain-of-the-alpha-male">
<img alt="Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_121.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95167/ring-of-king-kangrom">
<img alt="Ring of King Kangrom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_173.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of King Kangrom</span></a>, which can be a nice boost to item levels early on. With Phase 5, items from the celestial dungeons will generally be better than the items found from older world bosses.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>Nalak has the chance of dropping PvP gear, as well as T15 Gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95226/gauntlets-of-the-all-consuming-maw">
<img alt="Gauntlets of the All-Consuming Maw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gauntlets of the All-Consuming Maw</span></a> and Legs <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95228/greaves-of-the-all-consuming-maw">
<img alt="Greaves of the All-Consuming Maw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of the All-Consuming Maw</span></a>. Furthermore, they have a very small chance of dropping the rare mount <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95057/reins-of-the-thundering-cobalt-cloud-serpent">
<img alt="Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent</span></a>.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_staff_2h_pandarenmonk_c_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Timeless Isle Items for Frost Death Knights</span></h2>The Timeless Isle in Phase 5 is great for catching up on gear.  You will earn <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> for almost all activities that you participate in. Pretty much every piece except weapons can be obtained at item level 535, making it the best available gear before stepping into raid. However, farming <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103982/burden-of-eternity">
<img alt="Burden of Eternity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_monk_envelopingmist.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burden of Eternity</span></a> to fill every single slot will take a <b>considerable</b> amount of time. <br/>
<br/>Further, each item will come with a random suffix that dictates the stats on the item. As a tank, you only have access to suffixes like: <br/>
<i>…of the Earthfall Crit + Haste<br/>…of the Earthbreaker Crit + Mastery<br/>…of the Earthshaker Hit + Crit<br/>…of the Mountainbed	Haste + Mastery</i>
<br/>
<br/>Below is a table of the cost of trinkets, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103982/burden-of-eternity">
<img alt="Burden of Eternity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_monk_envelopingmist.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burden of Eternity</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104009/timeless-plate-armor-cache">
<img alt="Timeless Plate Armor Cache" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Plate Armor Cache</span></a> that drop a random piece of 496 item level gear (these drop quite frequently out in the world, so wouldn't recommend spending coins on them). <br/>
<br/>
