<a class="q2" href="/mop-classic/spell=146195/flurry-of-xuen">Your damaging attacks have a chance to trigger a Flurry of Xuen, causing you to deal 1 damage to <!--sp883:0-->up to 5 enemies in front of you<!--sp883-->, every 0.3 sec for 3 sec. (Approximately <!--rppm-->1.74<!--rppm--> procs per minute)</a>
